COMMENT ON TABLE release_order IS '泄流指令链：下达→签收→执行→回执，签收时限恰 15 分钟升级';
COMMENT ON COLUMN release_order.status IS 'ISSUED 下达 / SIGNED 签收 / EXECUTING 执行 / RECEIPTED 回执 / ESCALATED 已升级值班领导';
